Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Velociraptor fails to start

Check if ports 8000 and 8001 are available: netstat -tulpn | grep 800
Verify configuration file syntax: velociraptor --config server.config.yaml config show
Check logs in the logs directory for error messages
Issue: Permission denied when collecting data

Run collection scripts with sudo for system-level access: sudo python3 endpoint_collector.py
Ensure proper file permissions: chmod +x script.py
Check SELinux/AppArmor policies if enabled
Issue: Missing Python modules

Install all dependencies: pip3 install psutil
Use virtual environment to avoid conflicts: python3 -m venv venv && source venv/bin/activate
Verify Python version is 3.6 or higher: python3 --version
Issue: No data in correlation results

Ensure endpoint collection completed successfully
Verify memory analysis generated output files
Check that JSON files are valid: python3 -m json.tool < file.json
